== Trivia ==
* Lilith is the Hebrew name for a figure in Jewish mythology, thought to be derived from Mesopotamian mythology.
** Although Lilith is only mentioned in passing in the Biblical Book of Isaiah, later Jewish mythology expanded on her. In some stories, Lilith is the original woman God created before Eve. She refused to become subservient to Adam and left Eden; in others, she is depicted as the bane of humanity when Adam refused her, driving her to curse all of his descendants and targets children under her grudge.
* Cambion Conception is always listed as one of Lilith's starting items, even if it has not been unlocked.
* Lilith, as well as {{without context|{{dlc|na}}}} {{C|The Lost}} and {{C|Bethany}}, are the only non-tainted characters whose unlock conditions require a specific character.
* {{dlc|na+}} Lilith's starting health is listed as "?" on the character selection screen.
** {{dlc|a+}} Lilith's starting health is listed as "I" on the character selection screen, despite starting with one red heart and two black hearts.
* Lilith's locked character icon is a locked box with her Incubus on it.
** She shares this locked box icon with {{C|Judas}}, {{C|Azazel}}, and {{C|Apollyon}}.
* The recharge time of Box of Friends has been changed multiple times in order to balance Lilith. On her initial release, it recharged in just 2 rooms. Then an update increased the recharge time to 4 rooms. Finally, in {{dlc|r}} ''Repentance'', its recharge time was decreased to 3 rooms.

